# Table of contents: numbered headings carry their number in the entries, in the format of each level.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: en
	Title: Table of contents · Numbered headings
	Page:
		Paper: A5
		Margin: 15mm
	Styles:
		For element: Heading 1
