	Section:
		Text: Table of contents
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			In table of contents: false
			Typography:
				Numbered: false
			Text: Numbered headings
		Paragraph: A numbered heading takes its number into its entry, written as its level says. Here the chapters are in Roman numerals and their sections in digits, `I.1`. The title has `Numbered: false`, so it neither carries a number nor counts.
			Style: intro
		Text: Contents
			Style: contents
		Table of contents:
			Levels: 1 2
	Section:
		Heading 1:
			Text: Installation
		Heading 2:
			Text: Before starting
		Paragraph: Check that the box holds the thermostat, the base and four screws.
		Heading 2:
			Text: Wiring
		Paragraph: Connect the live wire to terminal L and the neutral to terminal N.
	Section:
		Heading 1:
			Text: Use
		Heading 2:
